<title>USA: Georgia Gulf Q2 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Georgia Gulf Q2 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended 6/30     6 Mos ended 6/30</p>
<p>				   1997	1996     1997	1996</p>
<p> Net sales		   $258,208 $231,387  $497,433 $439,423</p>
<p>Oper costs and expenses:</p>
<p>   Cost of sales	    206,430  184,294   409,890  351,412</p>
<p>   Selling &amp; admin	   11,874   10,926    22,972   21,734</p>
<p>Total operating costs</p>
<p>   and expenses	     218,304  195,220   432,862  373,146</p>
<p> Operating income	    39,904   36,167    64,571   66,277</p>
<p>Other income (expense)</p>
<p>   Interest, net	    (6,740)  (5,080)  (12,002)  (9,722)</p>
<p> Income before income taxes 33,164   31,087    52,569   56,555</p>
<p> Prov for income taxes     12,584   11,801    19,928   21,463</p>
<p> Net income		    20,580   19,286    32,641   35,092</p>
<p> Net EPS			   0.60     0.52	0.95     0.94</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs		 34,222   36,969    34,518   37,313</p>
<p>		 (In thousands, except for per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Full co name is Georgia Gulf Corp.</p>
